## Memory of the instance (memory-3layer)

This instance keeps its memory outside this repository: L0 (the identity), the project's SESSION.md and
project.md. The bot read those files and pasted their content below, because this run cannot read them
itself. Treat the text below as the memory you have: it is the whole of it, those paths are not files you
can open, and a part marked as cut is the newest end of a longer file, not the whole file.

